  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Using udon graphs, if you try to leave a comment node and reload the graph more than once it will disappear. Closing and reopening unity counts as one reload, so it's practically impossible to keep your comment nodes. If you have multiple comment nodes then one will disappear every reload in the reverse order it was made. Hitting undo doesn't work correctly and only brings back one at a time however it will still disappear after reloading again.\nTested on SDK3 version 2021.02.23.11.40",
